  "memo": "R03 holds because the CA-issued card was used from a US IP and AVS failed. Card is the only adverse family; no Linkage rule or household exception applies. No earlier outcome settles the order. R04 does not hold because the amount is below the category's 95th percentile. Row §6.6(b) applies, but the completed, failed id_check now decides under §5.3(b): decline, not escalate, because Linkage is absent. A legitimate new customer using a foreign-issued card is plausible, but the verification failure controls the recommendation. The order has not shipped; decline would void and refund it and block the account. No further check is needed."
